OMG Requirements Interchange Format (ReqIF) 1.2 Specification - Notice
================================================================================

This plugin fetches, at runtime and on the end user's own machine, the OMG Requirements
Interchange Format (ReqIF) 1.2 specification and its machine-readable files (reqif.cmof,
reqif.xsd, driver.xsd) directly from https://www.omg.org/spec/ReqIF/ (or copies them from a local
folder the user points to). None of these files, and nothing generated from them, is
redistributed, committed, or bundled with this repository or any release of it - see
sources/README.md for the exact files and URLs, and CLAUDE.md ("Committed vs git-ignored") for how
this is enforced.

The following notice is reproduced from the OMG ReqIF 1.2 specification (OMG Document Number
