prostep ivip ReqIF Implementation Guide - Notice
================================================================================

The "ReqIF Implementation Guide" (prostep ivip / VDA, version 1.7, 16 December 2019) is copyright
of the prostep ivip Association and the VDA, all rights reserved, and is not publicly available.

This plugin never downloads, redistributes, commits or bundles the guide or any text derived from
it. A user who holds a copy may import it into their own local, git-ignored knowledge base with
`reqifsharp-sage import-guide`; its extracted text then stays on that user's machine. The
inspection rules in tools/sage-cli/ReqIFSharp.Sage.Tools/Inspection that refer to the guide contain
only clause numbers and the project's own short descriptions of what is checked, not text from the
guide.

